<h3 align="start" nodeId="8a64a58498d64ecd8181074c213c8dd3">一、背景</h3>
<ul nodeId="f9c309a78e324ec88863bde545c1946a">
<li nodeId="cc93ea5709cf49589f9147818af499d3">
<p align="start" nodeId="d7a4c853bba44673accae2156274461a">数据安全、基础安全等相关风险领域需要在近线通过mafka传递日志消息等，当前近线画布缺少mafka消息通道，相关模型诉求无法平滑接入近线</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 align="start" nodeId="47f8161c969b4323a251987d8c8af6a5">二、名词解释</h3>
<p align="start" nodeId="51b683810e294268b5a76fdf8537c6eb">Mafka：<span color="">配置Mafka数据源Topic</span></p>
<h3 align="start" nodeId="0db687848efd40ce9fc5c28eb8e07022">三、操作指南</h3>
